guarantee: failure branch: a panic in the abort poll counts as a stop, not as "keep running"
file: crates/voicen-whisper/src/lib.rs
added_by: test-writer
expected: killed by panic_in_the_abort_poll_is_reported_aborted (the run continues and returns Ok instead of Err, 0 segments expected); not run: Windows CI only
--- old
    let answer = catch_unwind(AssertUnwindSafe(|| stop.abort.requested())).unwrap_or(true);
--- new
